  "summary": {
   "status": "complete",
   "text": "In June 2025, Eric Lin framed U.S. leadership in critical and emerging technologies, including artificial intelligence, as a question of maintaining advantage over potential adversaries. He called for accelerating research and development, dismantling regulatory barriers, strengthening domestic supply chains and manufacturing, spurring private-sector investment, and advancing American companies in global markets.",
